     * <p>

     * The added option is set as required. It may be specified as requiring an argument. This method is a shortcut for:

     * </p>

     * <pre>

     * <code>

     * Options option = new Option(opt, longOpt, hasArg, description);

     * option.setRequired(true);

     * options.add(option);

     * </code>

     * </pre>

